  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Primary Care Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will address interlinked health crisis by strengthening governance and service delivery for primary care and by enhancing the climate resilience of the health system and communities.  It will target 51 districts across five provinces, focusing on 14 climate-vulnerable districts, and will benefit 900,000 people&#x2014;half of whom belong to ethnic minorities. These communities will gain access to upgraded, better-equipped health facilities and more reliable services.</narrative>
  </description>
